@startuml figure_9-4_registration_handshake
' Chapter 9 - Simplified registration handshake
' Callback to the full OOCS/OORS flow in Chapter 7 (Figure 7-7).

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ParticipantPadding 14

participant "Data Product/\nSidecar" as SC
participant "Beth /\nMarketplace"    as MP

SC ->  MP : OOCS: register (on startup)
MP --> SC : OORS: acknowledged

note over SC, MP
  The product is now on the map;
  active metadata keeps flowing.
end note

@enduml
